  {
    "id": "N078-1-0020",
    "chapter": 78,
    "title": "老學士閑徵姽嫿詞　痴公子杜撰芙蓉誄",
    "source": "Dream-of-Red-Chamber-master/脂硯齋重評石頭記/chapters/chapter78.tex",
